  "question": {
    "html": "<p>An athlete of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"M\"></span> jumps vertically upward, lifting their centre of mass a distance <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"h\"></span> after losing contact with the ground.</p>\n<p>What is the impulse that acts on the athlete during contact with the ground?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Mgh\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{M}{gh}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"M\\sqrt{2gh}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{M}{\\sqrt{2}}\\sqrt{gh}\"></span></li></ol>"
